    <p class="lead">Two thousand years ago, someone in China wrote a field guide to a world that never existed — page after page of impossible mountains, distant tribes, forgotten gods and beasts that should not be able to live. Half of Chinese mythology was born inside this one strange book. Here are five of its inhabitants.</p>
